            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The icon, the panel and the island are excluded from screen capture. Not every app respects this — check it on a test call. macOS's own indicators (the orange microphone dot, the screen recording icon) cannot be hidden, but during a call with screen sharing they are on anyway because of Teams."
